    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "Example of current plan for fp4 in PyTorch core: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/146578.  It isn't close to landing, but it should look very similar when it lands.  2 fp4s packed into a byte, and no mathematical ops defined (so you'd have to implement casting to fp4x2 on your own).",
