  {
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "Update\uff1a\n\nI found that the root cause of the above problem is that torchao uses the ties round to the nearest even digit strategy (https://github.com/pytorch/ao/blob/main/torchao/prototype/custom_fp_utils.py#L11)when fp32 to fp4. But in triton, it uses the round up strategy (https://github.com/triton-lang/triton/blob/main/python/triton_kernels/triton_kernels/numerics_details/mxfp.py#L700) . Will it be modified here?",
    "created_at": "2025-07-11T03:21:10Z",
